{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tankiro is an action-packed parry combat game inspired by the Souls-like genre. Play as a lone tank defending Earth from an alien invasion, using only your tank barrel to attack and your armor to parry and block enemy strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle various alien bosses on Earth's surface, then take the fight to their mothership in space. Defeat them and save the planet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628730/extras/f2427d8bb222c03a5215a4e8b74c1ddf.poster.avif?t=1762538216\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628730/extras/f2427d8bb222c03a5215a4e8b74c1ddf.webm?t=1762538216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628730/extras/f2427d8bb222c03a5215a4e8b74c1ddf.mp4?t=1762538216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry-Based Combat System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Souls-Like Inspired Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Alien Invader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628730/460f45ee97a21f8d7189b33ffc85226e09d882e2.jpg"},{"name":"B. F. Robot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628730/6d446ec9c4fbf56b1685d7263b2ad90ebc3fd56e.jpg"},{"name":"Overcompensating Alien","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628730/c2877700ea9b33947fd3848c07c59f085d65119a.jpg"},{"name":"Chef Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams